WEBVTT

00:04:26.563 --> 00:04:31.063
And so then we can start operating
relatively independently

00:04:31.097 --> 00:04:32.863
as a whole organization

00:04:32.863 --> 00:04:35.163
because we're all moving
in the same direction,

00:04:35.197 --> 00:04:36.930
trying to do the same thing.

00:04:37.663 --> 00:04:41.263
And there's a really critically important
part of making that work,

00:04:41.297 --> 00:04:42.963
and that's communication.

00:04:43.497 --> 00:04:46.630
And everything about
communication has changed.

00:04:46.663 --> 00:04:47.830
We tend to think

00:04:47.863 --> 00:04:51.230
that communication is this waterfall
from the top to the bottom.

00:04:51.263 --> 00:04:54.730
The executives would tell somebody
and the next level would tell somebody

00:04:54.763 --> 00:04:56.930
and we'd go all the way down
to the shop floor

00:04:56.963 --> 00:04:59.163
and everybody would understand
what's going on.

00:04:59.197 --> 00:05:01.263
Well, it may not have worked
that well then,